chimera-spawn (1.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Provide Chimera Spawn 1.0.0 as a client/server systemd-nspawn manager
    with local Unix-domain HTTP/WebSocket access and optional mutually
    authenticated TLS remote access.
  * Build four binary packages from one source package: python3-chimera-spawn,
    chimera-spawn-client, chimera-spawn-server, and the chimera-spawn
    metapackage.
  * Keep remote listeners disabled until an administrator supplies TLS
    material. Package installation does not generate certificates or private
    keys.

 -- Thiago Camargo <thiagocmc@proton.me>  Tue, 15 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0000
